00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO All limits are read from the active model and generated evidence is ignored.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT retains infeasible targets while ENFORCE limits them per aircraft.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3HR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.05>CRE B3HE,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL100,250
