00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS B3HR TEM
00:00:01.21>DYNAMICS B3HE TEM
00:00:01.22>DYNAMICS B3LR TEM
00:00:01.23>DYNAMICS B3LE TEM
00:00:01.30>ENVELOPECHECKS B3HR CUSTOM HIGH_SPEED MACH_MAX ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:01.31>ENVELOPECHECKS B3HE CUSTOM HIGH_SPEED MACH_MAX ALTITUDE_MAX
00:00:01.32>ENVELOPECHECKS B3LR CUSTOM LOW_SPEED MACH_MIN
00:00:01.33>ENVELOPECHECKS B3LE CUSTOM LOW_SPEED MACH_MIN
